WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.900
Narrator: Five thousand fans, drums, singing - and one marshal who needs them to stop.

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.200
Narrator: Majed shouts and waves.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Majed: STOP! STOP! WAIT!

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.800
Narrator: Nobody listens.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.900
Narrator: Noura stands where they can see her, gives one clear signal and speaks calmly.

6
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.200
Noura: Stop here please.

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.500
Narrator: The crowd stops.

8
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.800
Narrator: What made the difference?

